    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fantastic three/four bedroom, extended semi-detached property to the market on St. Johns Park West, one of Clondalkin's most sought after locations. This mature and peaceful development boasts an idyllic setting close to Corkagh Park and is within walking distance of Clondalkin Village and its array of amenities including local shops, The Mill Shopping Centre, primary and secondary schools and leisure facilities. Internal living accommodation of c. 108sqm comprises of ; entrance hall, living room, dining room, kitchen, shower room and bed 4/ 2nd reception room to the ground floor. upstairs you will find three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom. Externally to the rear you will find a fully enclosed, low maintenance garden with a covered patio area, a brick built storage shed and side access to the front offering a driveway for off road parking.  No.8  is presented in turn key condition throughout having been meticulously maintained, extended, upgraded and improved by its current owners. Further benefits include gas central heating, double glazed windows and is presented in immaculate condition from top to bottom. Due to size, location and condition we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your early interest.\n\nFeatures\n\nBER C1\nc. 108 Sqm\nSemi detached\n3/4 bedrooms\n2 bathrooms\nEasy access to N7 & M50\nExtended to rear\nPristine condition\nNo onward chain\nFully fitted kitchen with built in applicances\nDouble glazed windows\nWalking distance to Corkagh Park\nClose to all local amenities\nPopular mature development\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nEntering the St. Johns development from the Fonthill Road, take your immediate left turn onto St. Johns road West and then the first right, No. 8 will be just up on your right hand side."
      },
      {
